    <bpmn:process id="W_W4282" name="W4282. COD Float, Working-Capital &amp; Cash-Conversion-Cycle Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Treasury cycle; float-aging (W4275); working-capital review
Frequency: Daily monitoring + monthly review
Volume: COD cash-in-motion (~PHP 150M/month GMV × COD share × float days)
Owner: Treasury (VS-18) / Finance (VS-17.4) / Payment Ops
Participants: Treasury (VS-18), FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), SCF (VS-105), Last-Mile (VS-06.3)
Source: workflow W4282 — COD Float, Working-Capital &amp; Cash-Conversion-Cycle Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4282_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4282_Lane1" name="Treasury">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4282_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4282_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4282_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4282_Lane2" name="FP&amp;A">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4282_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4282_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4282_Start4" name="Treasury cycle; float-aging (W4275); working-capital review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4282_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4282_Task5" name="Treasury/Finance measure COD float (cash-in-motion from delivery to bank…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury/Finance measure COD float (cash-in-motion from delivery to bank deposit, unremitted aging W4275), the cost-of-capital, and the COD contribution to the cash-conversion-cycle (links VS-105)
Responsible (R): Treasury / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4282_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4282_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4282_Task6" name="Treasury/Payment Ops manage the float (remittance SLA acceleration, deposit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury/Payment Ops manage the float (remittance SLA acceleration, deposit frequency, sweep), and quantify the working-capital released by faster COD cash
Responsible (R): Treasury / Payment Ops / Last-Mile
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4282_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4282_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4282_Task7" name="FP&amp;A incorporate COD float into working-capital planning/cash forecast…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: FP&amp;A incorporate COD float into working-capital planning/cash forecast (VS-17.4/VS-33.1), and feed SCF/CCC governance (VS-105)
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4282_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4282_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4282_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4282_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4282_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-658 (ensure controlled execution — COD Settlement, Working-Capital, Fraud &amp; Analytics (PA-142.3).) | - CTL-658: COD float measured &amp; aged; remittance SLA; float in cash forecast &amp; CCC (VS-105)
Owner: Treasury (VS-18) / Finance (VS-17.4) / Payment Ops</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4282_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4282_Annotation9" targetRef="W4282_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4282_Flow11" sourceRef="W4282_Start4" targetRef="W4282_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4282_Flow12" sourceRef="W4282_Task5" targetRef="W4282_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4282_Flow13" sourceRef="W4282_Task6" targetRef="W4282_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4282_Flow14" sourceRef="W4282_Task7" targetRef="W4282_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
