      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Analytics (W4287); payment-mix shift; new payment tech
Frequency: Periodic + on opportunity
Volume: COD program improvement &amp; future-state roadmap
Owner: Payment Ops / Ecommerce (VS-10) / Innovation (VS-30)
Participants: Ecommerce (VS-10), Innovation (VS-30), Treasury (VS-18), Marketing (VS-14), Finance (VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W4288 — COD Program Continuous Improvement &amp; Future-State (BNPL/Digital Shift)</bpmn:documentation>
