        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-658 (ensure controlled execution — COD Settlement, Working-Capital, Fraud &amp; Analytics (PA-142.3).) | - CTL-658: alternatives business-cased; privacy assessed (VS-91); pilots governed (VS-30); benefit realized &amp; tracked
Owner: Payment Ops / Ecommerce (VS-10) / Innovation (VS-30)</bpmn:text>
